18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:bold;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 18pt;">Share-Based Compensation Plan Information</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">The Company adopted the 2016 Equity Incentive Plan ("2016 Equity Plan") on March&#160;9, 2016, which became effective on May&#160;31, 2016, following stockholder approval. Subject to adjustment for certain changes in the Company&#8217;s capitalization, the aggregate number of shares of the Company&#8217;s common stock that may be issued under the 2016 Equity Plan will not exceed the sum of (i)&#160;two million five hundred thousand (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_m5mTOyDo1UCUbwRf9G33FQ" contextRef="Duration_5_31_2016_To_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_R8fwonyTckOvrJw_zNXuKQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="prts:MaximumNumberOfSharesAuthorizedToIssuedUnderConditionOne" scale="3" id="Narr_VSX_rZtGa0m4BjuiHkXjcw">2,500</ix:nonFraction>) new shares, (ii)&#160;the number of unallocated shares remaining available for the grant of new awards under the Company&#8217;s prior equity plans described below (the &#8220;Prior Equity Plans&#8221;) as of the effective date of the 2016 Plan (which was equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_m5mTOyDo1UCUbwRf9G33FQ" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_47Awo-244kyPCK7He-NrJw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="3" id="Narr_WYXVuWB7lEiWj0AZioesQA">3,894</ix:nonFraction> shares as of May&#160;31, 2016) and (iii)&#160;any shares subject to a stock award under the Prior Equity Plans that are not issued because such stock award expires or otherwise terminates without all of the shares covered by such stock award having been issued, that are not issued because such stock award is settled in cash, that are forfeited back to or repurchased by the Company because of the failure to meet a contingency or condition required for the vesting of such shares, or that are reacquired, withheld (or not issued) to satisfy a tax withholding obligation in connection with an award or to satisfy the purchase price or exercise price of a stock award. In addition, the share reserve will automatically increase on January&#160;1st of each&#160;year, for a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_5_31_2016_To_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_R8fwonyTckOvrJw_zNXuKQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="prts:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardMinimumPeriodBeforeShareReserveIncrease" id="Narr_r78G1wDIQUGpdLjtiGNszw">nine years</ix:nonNumeric>, commencing on January&#160;1, 2017 and ending on (and including) January&#160;1, 2026, in an amount equal to one million five hundred thousand (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_m5mTOyDo1UCUbwRf9G33FQ" contextRef="As_Of_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_47Awo-244kyPCK7He-NrJw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="3" id="Narr_SmTaS1vhmEejs587QQ_nQg">1,500</ix:nonFraction>) shares per&#160;year; however the Board of Directors of the Company may </p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-18</p></div></div>
