serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">act prior to January&#160;1st of a given&#160;year to provide that there will be no January&#160;1st increase in the share reserve for such&#160;year or that the increase in the share reserve for such&#160;year will be a lesser number of shares of common stock than would otherwise occur pursuant the automatic increase. Options granted under the 2016 Equity Plan generally expire no later than <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_5_31_2016_To_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_R8fwonyTckOvrJw_zNXuKQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationArrangementBySharebasedPaymentAwardExpirationPeriod" id="Narr_FIrrDTY1z0O6mvvQ27enoA">ten years</ix:nonNumeric> from the date of grant and generally vest over a period of <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_5_31_2016_To_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_R8fwonyTckOvrJw_zNXuKQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_bwxQtFz5vk-xPhMhZAZMyA">four years</ix:nonNumeric>. The exercise price of all option grants must be equal to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_i-MP-cCDxkeJwLmK3T0f-w" contextRef="Duration_5_31_2016_To_5_31_2016_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_R8fwonyTckOvrJw_zNXuKQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="prts:ExercisePriceOfOptionGrants" scale="-2" id="Narr_u8rwVcU500uGtHkVNjkBvQ">100</ix:nonFraction>% of the fair market value on the date of grant. As of January&#160;3, 2026, approximately <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_m5mTOyDo1UCUbwRf9G33FQ" contextRef="As_Of_1_3_2026_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_prts_A2016EquityPlanMember_it0a-rwVZEKvdKGYYPNOig" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesAvailableForGrant" scale="3" id="Narr_AiAQwQSxU0ii92OMf-8PtQ">1,099</ix:nonFraction> shares were available for future grants under the 2016 Equity Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The following tables summarizes the Company&#8217;s stock option activity for the fiscal&#160;years ended, and details regarding the options outstanding and exercisable as of January&#160;3, 2026 and December&#160;28,&#160;2024:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_12_29_2024_To_1_3_2026_FzjzYLwB5EmXAMEQRM5Giw" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfShareBasedCompensationStockOptionsActivityTableTextBlock" id="Tb_07TRj0b3ZEadCcc2eGykjw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;min-height:0.0pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;table-layout:auto;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:55.62%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:2.19%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:7.29%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:2.2%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:normal;width:1.35%;margin:0pt;